  "description": "The G Light Trail 3.0 stands proud where eMTB and MTB collides - a lightweight performer that binds all the essentials of mountain biking together. Radically different to our G Enduro and G Trail models, the G Light Trail brings you closer than ever to traditional mountain biking. Super-lightweight, its carbon frame, compact motor and battery, plus high-end components ensure the G Light Trail 3.0 dips inside that magical sub-20kg eMTB bracket. And the results are exponential! A carbon frame with mid-mount Air Drive motor and integrated battery, rolling on 29\" wheels, offers an unrivalled feeling out on the trail. Balanced geometry means trails can be attacked with confidence and ease. Rolling resistance is reduced and agility improved compared with heavier eMTB models.",
